---
// src/components/About.astro
---

<section id="about" class="about-section">
  <div class="about-inner">

    <!-- Who Is MDJ Electric -->
    <div class="reveal who-block">
      <h2 class="section-title about-h2">WHO IS <span class="gold-text">MDJ ELECTRIC?</span></h2>
      <div class="gold-line"></div>
      <div class="who-text">
        <p>
          MDJ Electric, LLC is a family-owned residential and commercial electrical company serving
          customers throughout Connecticut.
        </p>
        <p>
          Founded by owner and electrician Brian Pugliese, MDJ Electric was built on decades of
          hands-on experience in the electrical trade.
        </p>
        <p>
          Brian brings extensive knowledge in residential, commercial, and specialty electrical work,
          providing customers with dependable electrical solutions and professional service.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- The Story Behind MDJ -->
    <div class="story-grid reveal">

      <!-- Family photo -->
      <div class="story-photo-wrap">
        <img src="/images/family-photo.JPG" alt="The Pugliese family — MDJ Electric" class="story-photo hero-photo-fade" />
      </div>

      <!-- Story text -->
      <div class="story-text">
        <!-- <div class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</div> -->
        <h2 class="section-title story-h2">THE STORY BEHIND <span class="gold-text">MDJ ELECTRIC</span></h2>
        <div class="gold-bar" style="margin-bottom:28px;"></div>

        <p>At the heart of MDJ Electric, LLC is family.</p>
        <p>
          The name "MDJ" comes from the middle names of our four children and represents the dream
          behind this company — building something meaningful that our family can be proud of for
          years to come.
        </p>
        <p>
          After decades working as an electrician, Brian Pugliese decided to take the experience he
          gained in the trade and build something of his own.
        </p>
        <p>
          MDJ Electric was created from a blue-collar work ethic, a passion for the electrical trade,
          and the desire to create a future built through hard work and dedication.
        </p>
        <p>
          As a family-owned business, MDJ Electric represents more than electrical work. It represents
          commitment, perseverance, and showing our children what can be accomplished by pursuing a dream.
        </p>

        <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold story-cta">
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 12 20" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 0 L2 10 H7 L1 20 L12 7 H7 Z"/></svg>
          Work With Us
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section { padding: 100px 0; background: #111; }
  .about-inner { max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  /* Who block */
  .who-block { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 80px; }
  .about-h2 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.8rem); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .gold-line { width: 60px; height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg,#f1c600,#f5d633); margin: 0 auto 36px; border-radius: 2px; }
  .who-text {
    max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;
  }
  .who-text p { color: #aaa; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }

  /* Story layout */
  .story-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px; align-items: center;
  }

  .story-photo-wrap {
    border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }
  .story-photo { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

  .story-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }
  .story-h2 { font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem); color: #fff; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .story-text p { color: #aaa; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .story-cta { margin-top: 12px; width: fit-content; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-section { padding: 70px 0; }
    .story-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
    .story-photo-wrap { max-width: 380px; margin: 0 auto; aspect-ratio: 3/2; }
    .who-block { margin-bottom: 56px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .about-section { padding: 60px 0; }
    .about-inner { padding: 0 16px; }
    .story-photo-wrap { max-width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
    .story-cta { width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
